[sliver] Unavoidable fitted catch projections: the 1.4 mm upper tang keeper and 1.3 mm lower latch keeper retain the purchased keystone module. Their full native profiles and actual swing/insertion clearances are identified in the receptacle review. This does not establish printed latch life or physical support cleanup.
alternatives: Filling the keeper openings enters the module envelope. Removing or sloping the working projections changes tang/latch capture; a different retention arrangement requires a complete receptacle redesign.
