[thin] Numerical threshold boundary: these exact pairs span authored 3.000 mm anchor, wall or insert-host sections. Native interiors are material and endpoint coordinates differ by exactly 3.000 mm along the section axis. Floating-point inclusion at the 3 mm reach does not establish a smaller design section or qualify printed/load performance.
alternatives: Use an explicit numerical tolerance at the requested thickness threshold. Enlarging a nominal fitted section solely to change its rank has no dimensional basis.
